  "privacyIntro": "As a rule, Shiftbell does not collect personal information. Below is exactly what we store, why, and the few exceptions where anything leaves your device.",
  "privacyNoCollectionTitle": "Default - stored only on your device",
  "privacyNoCollectionBody": "Your shift schedule, alarm settings, memos/schedules, sleep records, and everything else the app creates are stored only on your device by default and are never sent to any server.",
  "privacyFirebaseTitle": "Exception - when you use Schedule Sharing",
  "privacyFirebaseBody": "When you use 'Schedule Sharing' to share your shift schedule, your schedule data is stored on Google Firebase servers from that moment on, viewable by anyone with your share code or link. Only the schedule content and an anonymous ID the app generates automatically are stored - never your real name, phone number, or location. You can stop sharing at any time in Settings, and doing so immediately deletes the data stored on the server as well. Checking for app updates also contacts Firebase, but only reads whether a newer version exists - no information about you is ever sent.",
  "privacyAdsTitle": "Advertising (Google AdMob)",
  "privacyAdsBody": "Banner ads served through Google AdMob may appear in parts of the app. Google and other ad providers may collect device identifiers and similar information for ad personalization, governed by Google's own privacy policy rather than this one.",
  "privacyPermissionsTitle": "Permissions the app requests",
  "privacyPermissionsBody": "• Notifications: to show pre-alarm reminders and alarm status\n• Display over other apps: to show the alarm screen even while you're using other apps\n• Exact alarms: so alarms ring precisely at the time you set\n\nYou can keep using the app without granting these, but some of the features above may be limited.",
  "privacyDataRetentionTitle": "Data retention and deletion",
  "privacyDataRetentionBody": "All data lives only on your device and is removed when you uninstall the app. Backup files created with the 'Backup' feature are also saved only to your device's Downloads folder and are never sent anywhere. Deleting data stored via Schedule Sharing follows the 'Schedule Sharing' section above.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "Not directed at children",
  "privacyChildrenBody": "This app is not directed at children under 14, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.",
  "privacyContactTitle": "Contact",
  "privacyContactBody": "For questions about using the app, please reach out here.\n• Tistory: lowvibe07.tistory.com\n• KakaoTalk Open Chat: search '교대시계 앱' (Shiftbell app)",
  "privacyEffectiveDate": "This privacy policy is effective as of September 7, 2026. If it changes, we'll announce it here and through the app's update notice.",
